 YesNoCancel;globalParms
⍝ Presents a "Yes", a "No" & a "Cancel button together with a message
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←'File:///',(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico')
 ⎕←globalParms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.YesNoCancel'Do you want to fix them before carrying on?'
